# Large or regenerable media stays out of git (GitHub's 100 MB file limit; and a video in the
# repository would be published wherever the repository is). See README.md for how to rebuild each.
build/
*.mp4
*.wav
*.m4a
# Recorded frames: re-created by video-project/capture (shots.json, which describes them, is kept).
recordings/*/
# Narration takes, when recorded, are delivered beside the repository, not in it.
audio/narration/
